{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "kvaylirzf6p2725d", "title": "Spring Data JPA访问MySQL数据", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u7c52a642\" id=\"u7c52a642\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9c149d3\" id=\"ub9c149d3\">JPA（Java Persistence API）用于对象持久化的 API，是 Java EE 5.0 平台标准的 ORM 规范，使得应用程序以统一的方式访问持久层。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1b4f1c2b\" id=\"u1b4f1c2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64c1e0a3\" id=\"u64c1e0a3\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee0627cf\" id=\"uee0627cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u784ffac8\" id=\"u784ffac8\">JDBC 也是一种规范和接口，不过 JDBC 是面向 SQL 的，使用起来比较繁琐。所以就有了 ORM 框架，建立了 Java 对象与数据库表之间的映射关系，可以通过直接操作对象来实现持久化，简化了操作的繁杂度。而 JPA 就是 ORM 框架的规范，值得一提的是 Hibernate 是符合 JPA 规范的，而 MyBatis 却不符合，因为 MyBatis 还是需要写 SQL 的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u283b746d\" id=\"u283b746d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38beb5ec\" id=\"u38beb5ec\"> </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud3e9f685\" id=\"ud3e9f685\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4eeb58b2\" id=\"u4eeb58b2\">虽然HIbernate用的人越来越少了，但是JPA这种统一的标准化接口在我们开发工作中仍然有重要意义。我们首先看下JDBC示意图：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4e30fd8f\" id=\"u4e30fd8f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43518495%2F1729001515808-714c4a2f-facf-4529-bca5-5373cd44fa56.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u29d856d7-da4c-42f9-9cd6-4fbe54f5afc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u625bbafc-28e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A600%2C%22height%22%3A368%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A115975%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A900%2C%22originHeight%22%3A552%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22shadow%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%84%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%3A%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A705%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JAVAAPPLICATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A361%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SQLSERVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A487%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MYSQL%22%2C%22x%22%3A96%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DBC%22%2C%22x%22%3A419%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORACLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DB2%22%2C%22x%22%3A726%2C%22y%22%3A486%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23edc2a1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u27690aef%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufb571536\" id=\"ufb571536\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7735f2fd\" id=\"u7735f2fd\">JPA示意图</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u301c8949\" id=\"u301c8949\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfa32c8e\" id=\"ucfa32c8e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc805a2b8\" id=\"uc805a2b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u444a6731\" id=\"u444a6731\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udcb39576\" id=\"udcb39576\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43518495%2F1729001452069-ddbb14ff-1d8d-4c37-b8fa-7e466dba69f6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3625f941-a460-4564-bbe0-92c3b509229%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u625bbafc-28e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A642.3333740234375%2C%22height%22%3A344%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A115851%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1184%2C%22originHeight%22%3A635%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22shadow%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E7%9A%84ORM%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A305%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HIBERNATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A201%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PA%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PA%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOPLINK%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefefe%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u237a1abb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua7210719\" id=\"ua7210719\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d5b9962\" id=\"u0d5b9962\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"IsVlz\" id=\"IsVlz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4219d64f\" id=\"u4219d64f\">Spring Data JPA使用：</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua0c57c2c\" id=\"ua0c57c2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68aa3b74\" id=\"u68aa3b74\">在开始使用Spring Data JPA之前，我们需要进行一些配置。首先，我们需要添加Spring Data JPA的依赖项。打开项目的pom.xml文件，并在&lt;dependencies&gt;标签中添加以下依赖：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud2cd982f\" id=\"ud2cd982f\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%3Cdependencies%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C!--%20Spring%20Data%20JPA%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.boot%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-boot-starter-data-jpa%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdependencies%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22oE0yE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubede09cf\" id=\"ubede09cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc986151\" id=\"ufc986151\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1fd96e38\" id=\"u1fd96e38\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufba4be5b\" id=\"ufba4be5b\">接下来，我们需要在项目的配置文件中进行数据源和JPA的相关配置。打开application.properties文件（或者application.yml文件），并添加以下配置：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud10d0efa\" id=\"ud10d0efa\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%23%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cnspring.datasource.url%3Djdbc%3Amysql%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A3306%2Fmydatabase%5Cnspring.datasource.username%3Droot%5Cnspring.datasource.password%3Dpassword%5Cn%5Cn%23%20JPA%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cnspring.jpa.show-sql%3Dtrue%5Cnspring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto%3Dupdate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22H9jqT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u25129ff5\" id=\"u25129ff5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u052687f7\" id=\"u052687f7\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u825e9964\" id=\"u825e9964\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue584c2cd\" id=\"ue584c2cd\">在这里，我们配置了数据库的连接信息以及JPA的一些属性。确保将spring.datasource.url中的mydatabase替换为你自己的数据库名称，并根据实际情况修改用户名和密码。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0d3a138b\" id=\"u0d3a138b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b1c94f7\" id=\"u3b1c94f7\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5e98f0ee\" id=\"u5e98f0ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubca42614\" id=\"ubca42614\">定义实体类和Repository接口</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uda6eddfc\" id=\"uda6eddfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u173fe8d4\" id=\"u173fe8d4\">在使用Spring Data JPA进行数据访问之前，我们需要定义实体类和Repository接口。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue7760182\" id=\"ue7760182\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc68318ce\" id=\"uc68318ce\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3bfc433c\" id=\"u3bfc433c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6e1f5fe\" id=\"ud6e1f5fe\">首先，我们需要定义实体类，它们代表了数据库中的表。在这个示例中，我们创建一个名为&quot;User&quot;的实体类：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub41df5b9\" id=\"ub41df5b9\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cnimport%20javax.persistence.Entity%3B%5Cnimport%20javax.persistence.GeneratedValue%3B%5Cnimport%20javax.persistence.GenerationType%3B%5Cnimport%20javax.persistence.Id%3B%5Cn%5Cn%40Entity%5Cnpublic%20class%20User%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40Id%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40GeneratedValue(strategy%20%3D%20GenerationType.IDENTITY)%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20Long%20id%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20String%20username%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20String%20password%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E3%80%81Getter%E5%92%8CSetter%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22uSl5W%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u90d963ee\" id=\"u90d963ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u978cc8a2\" id=\"u978cc8a2\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3304cf6c\" id=\"u3304cf6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7aafd2b0\" id=\"u7aafd2b0\">在这里，我们使用了@Entity注解将这个类标记为JPA实体，@Id注解表示该属性为主键，@GeneratedValue注解指定了主键的生成策略。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud27ad673\" id=\"ud27ad673\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0504275e\" id=\"u0504275e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u624d4b89\" id=\"u624d4b89\"><span data-lake-id=\"u120117cb\" id=\"u120117cb\">接下来，我们需要定义Repository接口，它是用于进行数据库操作的接口。在这个示例中，我们创建一个名为&quot;UserRepository&quot;的接口：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b975370\" id=\"u6b975370\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.JpaRepository%3B%5Cnimport%20com.example.model.User%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20interface%20UserRepository%20extends%20JpaRepository%3CUser%2C%20Long%3E%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20User%20findByUsername(String%20username)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22K60C9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4e8e5561\" id=\"u4e8e5561\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4b2119ce\" id=\"u4b2119ce\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8c6b55bd\" id=\"u8c6b55bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e0c1a79\" id=\"u5e0c1a79\">在这里，我们继承了JpaRepository接口，并指定了实体类类型和主键的类型。通过继承JpaRepository接口，我们就拥有了许多常用的数据访问方法，例如插入、查询、更新和删除等。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u40bedb18\" id=\"u40bedb18\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f8468b8\" id=\"u0f8468b8\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaaac70ee\" id=\"uaaac70ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b661480\" id=\"u9b661480\">使用Spring Data JPA进行数据访问</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf1c9f24e\" id=\"uf1c9f24e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue02a7e8d\" id=\"ue02a7e8d\">一旦我们完成了Spring Data JPA的配置和Repository接口的定义，我们就可以使用它进行数据访问了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucfad3de6\" id=\"ucfad3de6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufce0a994\" id=\"ufce0a994\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1115094a\" id=\"u1115094a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8b416a0\" id=\"uf8b416a0\">以下是一些示例代码，展示了如何使用Spring Data JPA进行数据库操作：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4468b53c\" id=\"u4468b53c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea8457b9\" id=\"uea8457b9\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b483d64\" id=\"u6b483d64\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42cc5be3\" id=\"u42cc5be3\">查询数据</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99db2942\" id=\"u99db2942\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40Autowired%5Cnprivate%20UserRepository%20userRepository%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20User%20getUserByUsername(String%20username)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20userRepository.findByUsername(username)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22l9iKS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue1ba10a3\" id=\"ue1ba10a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f4f0402\" id=\"u6f4f0402\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaddaa217\" id=\"uaddaa217\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8458cf0\" id=\"uf8458cf0\">在这个示例中，我们通过自动装配的方式获取了UserRepository实例，并使用它的findByUsername方法根据用户名查询用户信息。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u674538df\" id=\"u674538df\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51577835\" id=\"u51577835\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u869ce3b4\" id=\"u869ce3b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb2f7c28\" id=\"ucb2f7c28\">插入数据</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue1e228f9\" id=\"ue1e228f9\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40Autowired%5Cnprivate%20UserRepository%20userRepository%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20void%20addUser(User%20user)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20userRepository.save(user)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22h0Zkc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3ca915f5\" id=\"u3ca915f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b32608e\" id=\"u0b32608e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc32afda1\" id=\"uc32afda1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafce2662\" id=\"uafce2662\">这个示例展示了如何使用save方法插入用户数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0c62a94b\" id=\"u0c62a94b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7773db8c\" id=\"u7773db8c\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1d50249c\" id=\"u1d50249c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9cec7ed7\" id=\"u9cec7ed7\">更新数据</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8fe7b83d\" id=\"u8fe7b83d\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40Autowired%5Cnprivate%20UserRepository%20userRepository%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20void%20updateUser(User%20user)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20userRepository.save(user)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22rUCWS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1eda1eff\" id=\"u1eda1eff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2175b722\" id=\"u2175b722\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6c4cc748\" id=\"u6c4cc748\"><span data-lake-id=\"u854d6908\" id=\"u854d6908\">使用save方法同样可以更新已有的用户数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99a0aad1\" id=\"u99a0aad1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba1bcb80\" id=\"uba1bcb80\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2f6cb519\" id=\"u2f6cb519\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2eb13209\" id=\"u2eb13209\">删除数据</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%40Autowired%5Cnprivate%20UserRepository%20userRepository%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20void%20deleteUser(Long%20id)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20userRepository.deleteById(id)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DFhMP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue94a356d\" id=\"ue94a356d\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"APl6Z\" id=\"APl6Z\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3902ab27\" id=\"u3902ab27\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">Spring Data新特性 </span></h3><ol list=\"ud47b2c49\"><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"uce513335\" id=\"uce513335\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf53a6e9\" id=\"uaf53a6e9\">快速数据访问框架，提供统一的编程模型 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"u25d73b72\" id=\"u25d73b72\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39548cb1\" id=\"u39548cb1\">强大的repository仓储和自定义对象映射ORM抽象 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"uae61af66\" id=\"uae61af66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c6069f6\" id=\"u1c6069f6\">从repository方法名称派生动态查询接口 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"ue7bf54ec\" id=\"ue7bf54ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0749be82\" id=\"u0749be82\">实现Domain域基类提供基本属性 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"ubc0b5208\" id=\"ubc0b5208\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedaa38e9\" id=\"uedaa38e9\">支持透明审计日志（创建，最后更改） </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"u6a0fb8ff\" id=\"u6a0fb8ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a084546\" id=\"u3a084546\">可以自定义repository代码 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"u78a7b738\" id=\"u78a7b738\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc80e8c5c\" id=\"uc80e8c5c\">通过JavaConfig和自定义XML命名空间轻松实现Spring集成 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"uf541f312\" id=\"uf541f312\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc7f007b\" id=\"ufc7f007b\">与Spring MVC控制器的高级集成 </span></li><li fid=\"u35a378ce\" data-lake-id=\"u0fefa0e6\" id=\"u0fefa0e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8d83a20f\" id=\"u8d83a20f\">跨库持久性的实验支持</span></li></ol><h3 data-lake-id=\"qEghi\" id=\"qEghi\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6adbe9bd\" id=\"u6adbe9bd\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">Spring Data架构</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u1e6a0793\" id=\"u1e6a0793\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2022%2Fpng%2F402120%2F1666180122127-e08958c8-ffeb-46f8-b867-749699ab3c61.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9c5baeac-0fdd-41d1-be0b-f19007d72a8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf5c50674-e97a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A783%2C%22height%22%3A467%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_20221019154408.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A195196%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A977%2C%22o